21:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":["Google Drive"," — ","Penyimpanan cloud Google untuk file, cadangan, berbagi, dan kerja dokumen."," Developer: ","Google LLC",". Harga: ","Gratis dengan ruang penyimpanan akun Google; ruang lebih besar tersedia lewat langganan Google One berbayar",". Penilaian keamanan lengkapnya, termasuk izin yang diminta dan risikonya, ada di bagian “Apakah ","Google Drive"," Aman?” di bawah."]}]
